{
  "description": "阶段六：第二个完整 3D Layout 视口，各自相机、工具、输入和 GPU/fallback。性能计时验收暂缓，进程隔离单独实施。",
  "base_revision": "8317b5ffc7ef93a2a09570db5e89f3efaff42e63",
  "configuration": {
    "platform": "macOS",
    "architecture": "arm64",
    "build": "Release",
